{"path":"contact.html","content":"<!doctype html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="utf-8" />
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width,initial-scale=1" />
  <title>Connect — {{BUSINESS_NAME}}</title>
  <meta name="description" content="A modern, holistic line for integrative care. Reach out to ask about an intensive plan, consult availability, or a quick orientation call." />
  <style>
    :root{
      --bg:#0f1720;--card:#0b1220;--muted:#9aa6b2;--accent:#9bd5c6;--accent-2:#7cc3ff;--glass:rgba(255,255,255,0.03);
      --maxw:1100px;--radius:14px;--shadow:0 8px 30px rgba(2,6,23,0.7);
      font-family:Inter, ui-sans-serif, system-ui, -apple-system, "Segoe UI", Roboto, "Helvetica Neue", Arial;
    }
    html,body{height:100%;margin:0;background:linear-gradient(180deg,#071017 0%, #07121a 60%), url('assets/img/pattern.svg');color:#e6f3ef}
    a{color:var(--accent-2);text-decoration:none}
    .wrap{max-width:var(--maxw);margin:36px auto;padding:28px}
    header{display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;gap:18px}
    .brand{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:14px}
    .logo{width:62px;height:62px;border-radius:12px;background:linear-gradient(135deg,var(--accent),#5fb6ff);display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;box-shadow:var(--shadow);font-weight:700}
    nav{display:flex;gap:12px;align-items:center}
    nav a{padding:8px 12px;border-radius:10px;font-size:13px;color:rgba(230,243,239,0.9)}
    nav a[href$="contact.html"]{background:linear-gradient(90deg,rgba(255,255,255,0.03),rgba(255,255,255,0.02));backdrop-filter:blur(4px)}

    .hero{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 420px;gap:28px;margin-top:28px}
    .poster{background:linear-gradient(180deg,rgba(255,255,255,0.02),transparent),var(--glass);padding:34px;border-radius:var(--radius);box-shadow:var(--shadow);position:relative;overflow:hidden}
    .poster h1{margin:0;font-size:28px;letter-spacing:-0.02em}
    .poster p.lead{color:var(--muted);margin-top:12px}
    .contact-card{background:linear-gradient(180deg,rgba(255,255,255,0.02),transparent);padding:18px;border-radius:12px;box-shadow:inset 0 1px 0 rgba(255,255,255,0.02)}

    form{display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:10px}
    input,textarea,select{background:transparent;border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.06);padding:10px 12px;border-radius:10px;color:inherit}
    .row{display:flex;gap:8px}
    button.primary{background:linear-gradient(90deg,var(--accent),var(--accent-2));border:none;padding:10px 14px;border-radius:10px;color:#072026;font-weight:700}
    .meta{font-size:13px;color:var(--muted);margin-top:8px}

    /* Proof gallery */
    .proof{margin-top:22px;padding:14px;border-radius:12px;background:linear-gradient(180deg,rgba(255,255,255,0.01),transparent);display:flex;gap:14px;align-items:center}
    .testi{flex:1}
    .testi blockquote{margin:0;font-size:14px;color:#e6f3ef}
    .testi .who{font-size:13px;color:var(--muted);margin-top:8px}
    .badges{display:flex;gap:8px;align-items:center}
    .badge{position:relative;padding:8px;border-radius:10px;background:rgba(255,255,255,0.02);font-size:12px;color:var(--muted);cursor:default}
    .badge svg{height:16px;width:16px;vertical-align:middle;margin-right:8px;opacity:0.95}
    .badge .tip{position:absolute;left:50%;transform:translateX(-50%);bottom:calc(100% + 8px);background:#051219;padding:8px;border-radius:8px;color:var(--accent);font-size:12px;white-space:nowrap;opacity:0;pointer-events:none;transition:opacity .18s ease}
    .badge:hover .tip{opacity:1}

    /* Pricing comparator */
    .compare{margin-top:18px;padding:14px;border-radius:12px;background:linear-gradient(180deg,transparent,rgba(255,255,255,0.01));display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 160px;gap:12px;align-items:center}
    .plans{display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:8px}
    .plan{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;padding:10px;border-radius:10px;background:rgba(255,255,255,0.02)}
    .toggle{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;justify-content:center}
    .switch{width:72px;height:34px;background:rgba(255,255,255,0.04);border-radius:20px;padding:4px;display:flex;align-items:center;position:relative}
    .knob{width:28px;height:26px;border-radius:14px;background:linear-gradient(180deg,#fff,#d6f6ee);position:absolute;left:4px;transition:left .28s cubic-bezier(.2,.9,.3,1);box-shadow:0 6px 18px rgba(8,20,30,0.6)}
    .switch.on .knob{left:40px}
    .muted{color:var(--muted);font-size:13px}
    .price{font-weight:800;color:var(--accent-2);font-size:18px}

    footer{margin-top:36px;padding:20px;color:var(--muted);font-size:13px;text-align:center}

    /* small screens */
    @media (max-width:900px){
      .hero{grid-template-columns:1fr;}
      .brand .logo{width:52px;height:52px}
    }
  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <div class="wrap">
    <header>
      <div class="brand">
        <div class="logo">HM</div>
        <div>
          <div style="font-weight:700">{{BUSINESS_NAME}}</div>
          <div style="font-size:12px;color:var(--muted)">{{TAGLINE}}</div>
        </div>
      </div>
      <nav>
        <a href="index.html">Overview</a>
        <a href="services.html">Offerings</a>
        <a href="conditions.html">Conditions</a>
        <a href="approach.html">Philosophy</a>
        <a href="pricing.html">Investments</a>
        <a href="about.html">Who We Are</a>
        <a href="book.html">Reserve</a>
        <a href="contact.html">Connect</a>
      </nav>
    </header>

    <div class="hero">
      <section class="poster">
        <h1>Connect for an intensive orientation</h1>
        <p class="lead">An invitation to explore an integrative, person-centered plan — paced to your life and priorities. Use this page to ask about an intensive intake, scheduling, or to request materials.</p>

        <div style="display:flex;gap:12px;margin-top:18px;flex-wrap:wrap">
          <div class="contact-card" style="flex:1">
            <div style="font-size:13px;color:var(--muted)">Phone</div>
            <div style="font-weight:700">{{PHONE}}</div>
            <div style="height:8px"></div>
            <div style="font-size:13px;color:var(--muted)">Email</div>
            <div style="font-weight:700">{{EMAIL}}</div>
            <div class="meta">Office: {{CITY}}, {{STATE}} • Please note we do not diagnose by email. This contact form is for orientation and booking requests only.</div>
          </div>

          <div class="contact-card" style="width:320px">
            <form id="contactForm" onsubmit="event.preventDefault();submitContact();">
              <input id="name" placeholder="Your full name" required />
              <input id="contact" placeholder="Phone or email" required />
              <select id="interest">
                <option value="orientation">Orientation call (30m)</option>
                <option value="intake">Intensive intake (90m)</option>
                <option value="follow">Follow-up planning</option>
                <option value="materials">Request materials</option>
              </select>
              <textarea id="note" rows="3" placeholder="Short note or priorities (optional)"></textarea>
              <div class="row">
                <button class="primary" type="submit">{{PRIMARY_CTA_LABEL}}</button>
                <button type="button" onclick="location.href='{{PRIMARY_CTA_URL}}'" style="background:transparent;border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.06);padding:10px;border-radius:10px;color:var(--muted)">Book directly</button>
              </div>
              <div id="formMsg" class="meta" style="display:none"></div>
            </form>
          </div>
        </div>

        <!-- Proof gallery -->
        <div class="proof" aria-live="polite">
          <div class="testi" id="testiArea">
            <blockquote id="quote">"The intake felt like a compass: practical steps and room for my story."</blockquote>
            <div class="who" id="who">— L., mid-career educator</div>
          </div>
          <div class="badges" id="badges">
            <div class="badge" data-tip="Board-certified functional health practitioners">
              <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="10" stroke="currentColor" stroke-opacity="0.2"/><path d="M7 13l3 3 7-7" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/></svg>
              Practitioner Board
              <div class="tip">Practitioner Board • Verified credentials</div>
            </div>
            <div class="badge" data-tip="Featured in regional wellness press">
              <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><rect x="4" y="4" width="16" height="16" rx="3" stroke="currentColor" stroke-opacity="0.22"/><path d="M8 12h8" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6" stroke-linecap="round"/></svg>
              In the Press
              <div class="tip">Local press feature about integrative plans</div>
            </div>
            <div class="badge" data-tip="Community referrals and patient-reported outcomes">
              <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><path d="M12 20s6-4 6-10a6 6 0 10-12 0c0 6 6 10 6 10z" stroke="currentColor" stroke-opacity="0.2"/><circle cx="12" cy="10" r="2" fill="currentColor"/></svg>
              Community-Verified
              <div class="tip">Peer and patient network referrals</div>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="meta">Selected testimonials rotate. Badges show short clarifications on hover. All feedback is anonymized to respect privacy.</div>

      </section>

      <aside>
        <div class="contact-card">
          <div style="font-weight:700">Quick comparator</div>
          <div style="font-size:13px;color:var(--muted);margin-bottom:10px">Toggle between monthly maintenance and the intensive package — numbers animate.</div>

          <div class="compare">
            <div class="plans">
              <div class="plan"><div class="muted">Intro Session</div><div class="price" data-month="85" data-package="120">$<span class="num" data-role="intro">85</span></div></div>
              <div class="plan"><div class="muted">Comprehensive Intake</div><div class="price" data-month="220" data-package="320">$<span class="num" data-role="intake">220</span></div></div>
              <div class="plan"><div class="muted">Follow-up (per)</div><div class="price" data-month="95" data-package="75">$<span class="num" data-role="follow">95</span></div></div>
            </div>
            <div style="display:flex;flex-direction:column;align-items:center;gap:12px">
              <div class="toggle">
                <div style="font-size:13px;color:var(--muted)">Monthly</div>
                <div class="switch" id="priceSwitch" role="switch" aria-checked="false" tabindex="0">
                  <div class="knob"></div>
                </div>
                <div style="font-size:13px;color:var(--muted)">Package</div>
              </div>
              <div style="font-size:12px;color:var(--muted);text-align:center">Toggle to see per-session pricing or package rates that reduce per-session cost.</div>
            </div>
          </div>

          <div style="margin-top:12px">
            <button class="primary" onclick="location.href='{{PRIMARY_CTA_URL}}'">Request an intensive</button>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div style="height:12px"></div>
        <div class="contact-card">
          <div style="font-size:13px;color:var(--muted)">Hours</div>
          <div style="font-weight:700">Mon–Thu • 9:00–17:00</div>
          <div style="height:8px"></div>
          <div class="meta">We strive to respond within 48 business hours. If this is an emergency, please call local emergency services.</div>
        </div>
      </aside>
    </div>

    <section style="margin-top:28px;background:linear-gradient(180deg,rgba(255,255,255,0.01),transparent);padding:18px;border-radius:12px">
      <div style="font-weight:700">Accessibility & Privacy</div>
      <div style="color:var(--muted);margin-top:8px">We keep contact notes limited and secure. Messages are used to plan care and booking. This site provides educational material and does not replace clinical judgment.</div>
    </section>

    <footer>
      <div>&copy; <span id="year"></span> {{BUSINESS_NAME}} • <a href="privacy.html">Privacy</a> • <a href="terms.html">Terms</a></div>
    </footer>
  </div>

  <script>
    // Year
    document.getElementById('year').textContent = new Date().getFullYear();

    // Contact form basic UX
    function submitContact(){
      var msg = document.getElementById('formMsg');
      msg.style.display='block';msg.style.color='var(--muted)';msg.textContent='Sending…';
      setTimeout(function(){ msg.style.color='var(--accent)'; msg.textContent='Thanks — we received your request and will reply within 48 business hours.'; document.getElementById('contactForm').reset(); },1200);
    }

    // Proof gallery rotation
    (function(){
      var quotes = [
        {q:'"Our planning call left me with a clear map: practical steps I could try this week."', who:'— S., nonprofit director'},
        {q:'"A thoughtful intake that held my story and gave me doable next steps."', who:'— R., community artist'},
        {q:'"Helpful, individualized recommendations and steady follow-up."', who:'— T., parent & teacher'}
      ];
      var idx=0, elQuote=document.getElementById('quote'), elWho=document.getElementById('who');
      setInterval(function(){ idx=(idx+1)%quotes.length; fadeText(quotes[idx]); },4200);
      function fadeText(item){ elQuote.style.opacity='0'; elWho.style.opacity='0'; setTimeout(function(){ elQuote.textContent=item.q; elWho.textContent=item.who; elQuote.style.opacity='1'; elWho.style.opacity='1'; },260); }
    })();

    // Badges: show data-tip is handled by CSS tooltip. No extra JS required here beyond cursor accessibility

    // Pricing comparator with animated numbers
    (function(){
      var switchEl = document.getElementById('priceSwitch');
      var isPackage=false; // false = monthly
      var nums = document.querySelectorAll('.num');
      function animateAll(toPackage){
        nums.forEach(function(n){
          var parent = n.closest('.price');
          var from = parseFloat(n.textContent) || 0;
          var to = toPackage ? parseFloat(parent.getAttribute('data-package')) : parseFloat(parent.getAttribute('data-month'));
          animateValue(n, from, to, 420);
        });
      }
      function animateValue(node, start, end, duration){
        var startTime=null; var diff=end-start;
        function step(ts){ if(!startTime) startTime=ts; var progress = Math.min((ts-startTime)/duration,1); var cur = Math.round(start + diff * easeOutCubic(progress)); node.textContent = cur; if(progress<1) requestAnimationFrame(step); }
        requestAnimationFrame(step);
      }
      function easeOutCubic(t){ return (--t)*t*t+1 }

      switchEl.addEventListener('click',toggle);
      switchEl.addEventListener('keydown',function(e){ if(e.key==='Enter' || e.key===' ') { e.preventDefault(); toggle(); } });
      function toggle(){ isPackage = !isPackage; switchEl.classList.toggle('on', isPackage); switchEl.setAttribute('aria-checked', isPackage); animateAll(isPackage); }

      // init
      animateAll(false);
    })();

  </script>
</body>
</html>"} 
{"path":"README.md","content":"# holistic_medicine-MORE-2026-02-17T18-06-58-661Z-005 — Contact page chunk

This bundle contains the contact page and a README for the holistic / integrative medicine site variant (layoutFamily: poster_hero, voiceFamily: mystic_modern, offerModel: intensive).

Files included in this chunk:
- contact.html — The contact / connect page with local JS widgets and accessible markup.
- README.md — This file.

Design & UX highlights:
- Poster-style hero on the contact page with a split layout (intro + contact form + quick comparator).
- Proof Gallery: rotating testimonials with credibility badges that reveal clarifying tooltips on hover. Implemented with minimal JS and pure CSS tooltips for accessibility.
- Pricing Comparator: a small monthly vs package toggle. Values animate with requestAnimationFrame for a polished micro-interaction.
- All links use the project page slugs: index.html, services.html, conditions.html, approach.html, pricing.html, about.html, book.html, contact.html.

Placeholders present (replace as needed):
- {{BUSINESS_NAME}}
- {{TAGLINE}}
- {{PHONE}}
- {{EMAIL}}
- {{PRIMARY_CTA_LABEL}}
- {{PRIMARY_CTA_URL}}
- {{CITY}}
- {{STATE}}

Accessibility & notes:
- The contact form is not wired to a backend here; submitContact() simulates a response. Replace with your API endpoint as needed.
- The page includes a clear privacy/accessibility notice and emergency guidance.
- No external assets or fonts are required. The page references an SVG pattern at assets/img/pattern.svg for background texture — ensure that file exists in the broader bundle and is unique for this project.

Customization tips:
- Edit testimonial text in the contact.html script array to update rotation.
- Update pricing data attributes on the price elements (data-month and data-package) to reflect your current investment structure.
- Swap the brand initials in the .logo element with an inline SVG or image if you prefer; keep the layout responsive.

Legal & clinical note:
- The content is educational and supportive. It avoids medical guarantees and suggests using the contact form for planning and booking only.

